        "username": "speedyolrac",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-13T05:25:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><strong>My nightmare team.</strong></p><p>I am going to not try to get angry at everyone hating on Nightmist and AZ. Some people use some heroes diffently and find value where other can not. I pesonaly like Redemer Fanatic and dark watch setback there is just a whole diffent way to use her deck.</p><p>Also with the randomness of the game you will be supprise who will win. The <span>Absolute Zero,</span><span>&nbsp;Legacy,</span><span>&nbsp;Argent Adept,</span><span>&nbsp; Visionary,&nbsp;</span><span>Engine of War Bunker Group I find to be amazing. Have you ever had a turn 1 Brain burn on Chairman? Easy win. But a group of low damge / slow build up can make it an up hill battle.</span></p><p><span>So I will go with the group I least enjoy playing. They are good but I get no joy playing them.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>1) Base Legacy &nbsp; (Love youngest)</span></p><p><span>2) Omnitron &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (Too many reset just killed the fun)</span></p><p><span>3) Parse &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(I really want to like her, she has the power set I love)</span></p><p><span>4)The Naturalist &nbsp;(He is 3 of my friend fav so i don't miss out on much)</span></p><p><span>5)Expatriette or RA (Expat because i dislike guns, but hair tigger shenanigans, Ra is boring but great if I just wanna relax and watch the world burn.)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
