        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-13T06:25:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh, for a least <em>enjoyable</em> team, I'd go with Legacy, Tempest, Sentinels, Team Leader Tachyon, and Dark Visionary.&nbsp; Also known as \"just say 'we won' and pick the cards back up.\"&nbsp; For raw power, I should maybe swap The Scholar or Omnitron-X in there somewhere, but Scholar is new enough to me that always enjoy his minigames even when they're broken, and Omnitron X actually has some bad matchups/draws, so it's less of a sure thing.</p>",
