        "id": 161965,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-13T10:48:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Legacy is really good, this is true, but say you have him on a team that has no ongoing/environment destruction and you come up against Dawn. Your other heroes can do decent damage and take out the citizens. But then Return with the Dawn comes out. And another copy. And you can't get rid of them. Or Channel the Eclipse (however many copies there are of that), so Dawn keeps playing extra cards to bring out more citizens and is rezzing the dead ones as fast as you can kill them. And two of them are Anvil and Truth, of course. And Sweat and Tears. And there's nothing you can do about it.</p><p>Okay that's just one villain out of...however many there are, but think how many villains have a bunch of ongoings that, if left out, can just totally wreck you through either buffing the villain's damage, giving them soak/immunity to stuff, letting them bring out targets. And very few of these ongoings tend to have a \"you can do X to destroy this card\" thing on them (Miss Info's ones are the only ones I can think of). So you would be stuck with them for the whole game once they came out. Yaaay, Backlash Fields!</p>",
