        "id": 161967,
        "name": "mlangsdorf",
        "username": "mlangsdorf",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c4cdca/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-14T17:46:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Scholar, Mr Fixer, Bunker, Ra, and Haka.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm playing this team (well, Ra, Mr. Fixer, Bunker, Haka, Scholar) against Omnitron in Ruins of Atlantis, and it's going pretty rough. Sedative Flechettes and Singularities keep wiping the board state and they're just not doing enough damage fast enough. They can mostly work around the Adapative Plating Routines (both are out) but if this was Baron Blade with double Backlash Fields they'd be done.</p>",
