        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-14T19:13:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Anything with Bunker...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I've said this in other threads over the years, but the key with Redeemer Fanatic is to not worry about Wrathful as much as setting up Divine Focus and Sacrosanct Martyr. &nbsp;Those two cards are excellent and the the base power you actually find Wrathful faster. &nbsp;You can then use those cards to nuke people, hurt yourself and still have cards in hand when it's Wrathful time</p>",
