        "created_at": "2016-02-14T19:26:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have no problem with Bunker but I will admit Termination Bunker is the most interesting version of him. &nbsp;I just was trying to compose a team that no Ongoing destruction (at least without having one of those members incapped ) but any five hero team should still do alright. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
